ModuleDocComment 0..94 "//! Storage per thread (spec 07, section 2): each thread counts in its own storage of `count`,"
Whitespace 94..95 "\n"
ModuleDocComment 95..188 "//! the thread 5 past the 1 it starts with, the main thread 30, and neither sees the other's."
Whitespace 188..189 "\n"
ModuleDocComment 189..275 "//! A system running one thread counts on it alone: 31, and 6 in place of the other's."
